source-cpp\">M</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Ensures that the elements of the underlying view are tuple-like values<span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx23\"><span>, see <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/tuple-like\"><code><i>tuple-like</i></code></a></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></span></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Ensures that dangling references cannot be returned.</div>\n<p><code>elements_view</code> models the concepts <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/random_access_range\"><code>random_access_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/bidirectional_range\"><code>bidirectional_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/forward_range\"><code>forward_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><code>common_range</code></a>, and <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/sized_range\"><code>sized_range</code></a> when the underlying view <code>V</code> models respective concepts.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member name\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-dsc-small\"></span> <code><i>base_</i></code> <span class=\"t-mark\">(private)</span>\n</td>\n<td> the underlying (adapted) view of type <code>V</code><br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member object*</span>)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/elements_view/elements_view\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>elements_view</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div cla