 class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> enable_borrowed_range<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ranges</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">elements_view</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/borrowed_range\"><span class=\"kw3301\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">enable_borrowed_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>This specialization of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/borrowed_range\"><span class=\"kw3301\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">enable_borrowed_range</span></span></a></span> makes <code>elements_view</code> satisfy <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/borrowed_range\"><code>borrowed_range</code></a> when the underlying view satisfies it.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;tuple&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><